# Magicite (Windurst 4-1) at status 3, the stones set by a GM one by one: _6r9 with two of the three: nothing from the
# mission (its file answers nil there), _6r9's own 138; Aldo with any stone: 183; the three stones and the Airship Pass:
# _6r9 60 (1, 0), whose finish takes the stones, gives 20000 gil, the title and status 4.
lists RuludeGardens/_6r8/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Pakh_Jatalfih/onTrigger RuludeGardens/_6r9/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/131 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/128 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/60 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/37 LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Muckvix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/152 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/184 UpperJeuno/Geebeh/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Paya-Sabya/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/80 AltarRoom/Magicite/onTrigger AltarRoom/onZoneIn/1 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/44 AltarRoom/onEventFinish/10000 MonasticCavern/Magicite/onTrigger MonasticCavern/onEventFinish/0 QulunDome/Magicite/onTrigger QulunDome/onEventFinish/0
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=34,9,-33 job=WAR lvl=50 nation=2
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
mission Windurst ToEachHisOwnRight completed
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
mission Windurst ANewJourney completed
mission Windurst Magicite current
keyitem MagiciteAurastone
keyitem MagiciteOrastone
keyitem AirshipPass
login
missionstatus Windurst 3
trigger _6r9                            # the Optistone missing: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
keyitem MagiciteOptistone
delkeyitem MagiciteAurastone
trigger _6r9                            # the Aurastone missing: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
keyitem MagiciteAurastone
delkeyitem MagiciteOrastone
trigger _6r9                            # the Orastone missing: nothing from the mission
finish-if-event
warp 20,3,-56 LowerJeuno
trigger Aldo                            # the Optistone and the Aurastone: 183
finish-if-event
delkeyitem MagiciteOptistone
trigger Aldo                            # the Aurastone alone: 183
finish-if-event
delkeyitem MagiciteAurastone
keyitem MagiciteOrastone
trigger Aldo                            # the Orastone alone: 183
finish-if-event
keyitem MagiciteOptistone
delkeyitem MagiciteOrastone
trigger Aldo                            # the Optistone alone: 183
finish-if-event
keyitem MagiciteAurastone
keyitem MagiciteOrastone
warp 34,9,-33 RuludeGardens
trigger _6r9                            # the three stones and the pass: 60 (1, 0)
finish                                  # the stones taken, 20000 gil, the title, status 4
